    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Design your site with very simple yet powerful blocks of slider and accordion blocks, and streamline editing with beautiful patterns and extended toolbars.</p>\n<p>In Gutenberg Block Template &amp; Design Gallery, Just select your favorite design. Instantly create page section elements. Like a very simple page builder.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lqd.jp/wp/plugin/blocks_pro.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LIQUID BLOCKS Pro</a> unlocks even more advanced features.</p>\n<p>Talk Style Block is here <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/liquid-speech-balloon/\" rel=\"ugc\">LIQUID SPEECH BALLOON</a>.</p>\n<p>latest information on <a href=\"https://lqd.jp/wp/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LIQUID PRESS</a>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pNpv_SA_NNY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h4>Blocks</h4>\n<p>Simple yet powerful blocks.<br />\n* Carousel Slider (Slideshow, Fade)<br />\n* Tabs<br />\n* Accordion<br />\n* Card<br />\n* Custom Field<br />\n* Fixed Follow (Pro)<br />\n* If Condition (Pro)</p>\n<h4>Extension</h4>\n<p>Toolbar &amp; Settings Extension.<br />\n* Mark<br />\n* Underline<br />\n* Big<br />\n* Small<br />\n* Table Width</p>\n<h4>Patterns</h4>\n<p>Carefully selected 37+ Free Designs.<br />\n* Headlines<br />\n* Layouts (Q&amp;A, Ranking, Column, Step, Fluid Shape.)<br />\n* Price list<br />\n* CTA<br />\n* Landing pages<br />\n* Block Patterns (You can register.)</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload &#8216;liquid-blocks&#8217; to the &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/&#8217; directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Use &#8216;LIQUID BLOCKS&#8217; in the &#8216;Gutenberg editor&#8217; menu</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"q%3A%20this%20block%20contains%20unexpected%20or%20invalid%20content%3F\">\nQ: This block contains unexpected or invalid content?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>A: Try More options &gt; Attempt Block Recovery.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Fixed Follow block and Table Width features.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Tabs block and If Condition Block.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Custom Field block and Update Slider Block.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Carousel Slider, Accordion, and Card blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports block patterns.</li>\n<li>Added multiple insertion function.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with AMP.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Feature updates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>A first version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "This plugin extends the block editor.",
    "description": "<p>Design your site with very simple yet powerful blocks of slider and accordion blocks, and streamline editing with beautiful patterns and extended toolbars.</p>\n<p>In Gutenberg Block Template &amp; Design Gallery, Just select your favorite design. Instantly create page section elements. Like a very simple page builder.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lqd.jp/wp/plugin/blocks_pro.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LIQUID BLOCKS Pro</a> unlocks even more advanced features.</p>\n<p>Talk Style Block is here <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/liquid-speech-balloon/\" rel=\"ugc\">LIQUID SPEECH BALLOON</a>.</p>\n<p>latest information on <a href=\"https://lqd.jp/wp/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LIQUID PRESS</a>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pNpv_SA_NNY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<h4>Blocks</h4>\n<p>Simple yet powerful blocks.<br />\n* Carousel Slider (Slideshow, Fade)<br />\n* Tabs<br />\n* Accordion<br />\n* Card<br />\n* Custom Field<br />\n* Fixed Follow (Pro)<br />\n* If Condition (Pro)</p>\n<h4>Extension</h4>\n<p>Toolbar &amp; Settings Extension.<br />\n* Mark<br />\n* Underline<br />\n* Big<br />\n* Small<br />\n* Table Width</p>\n<h4>Patterns</h4>\n<p>Carefully selected 37+ Free Designs.<br />\n* Headlines<br />\n* Layouts (Q&amp;A, Ranking, Column, Step, Fluid Shape.)<br />\n* Price list<br />\n* CTA<br />\n* Landing pages<br />\n* Block Patterns (You can register.)</p>\n",
